<p>Creates an info popup icon</p>
<b>Parameters</b>
<ul><li> id = Unique identifier for the info popup</li>
<li> sourceFileName = File containing info content</li>
<li> sourcePageName = Page where info content is located</li>
<li> title = Optional title for the info popup</li>
</ul>
